The Telecom Revenue & Profitability Dashboard provides an integrated view of revenue, profitability, customer behaviour, payment performance, customer service activity, and churn-risk indicators across markets, regions,
 plans, segments, and device categories.
\par The analysis indicates that the business has broadly consistent profitability across regions, while opportunities exist to improve customer value through targeted upselling and more selective discounting. The analys
is also shows that device category and repeat ticket frequency alone are not strong indicators of churn risk or customer dissatisfaction. Overall, management should focus on targeted customer strategies, margin protection, and deeper investigation of the 
factors behind differences in customer value.
